e('Nobody does that in production. This lesson covers the two standards','Production platforms automate those primitives. This lesson covers the three standards','Noabsolute nobody;three specs nottwo.',[cri])
e('In 2015 the **Open Container Initiative (OCI)** standardised them so that any tool could build, ship and run containers interchangeably.','The **Open Container Initiative (OCI)** was established in 2015; its specifications support interoperability across tools.','Foundingnotallthreefinalstandards2015.',[i])
e('That is why an image built by Docker runs under Podman, containerd or Kubernetes without conversion.','Compatible Docker/OCI images can be used by runtimes underlying these platforms. OS/architecture, media types and required runtime features must still match.','Standarddoesnotguaranteeeveryimageeveryplatform.',[i,cri])
e('An image is not one file. It is a small graph of **content-addressed blobs**: each is named by the SHA-256 digest of its bytes.','An OCI image is a graph of **content-addressed blobs**, which can also be packaged in an archive. Descriptors identify bytes using a digest algorithm and value; SHA-256 is widely used, but the format is not limited to it.','Notonlysha256ornotonearchive.',[d])
e('Unpacked and stacked, they become the overlayfs lower directories.','Applying the changesets produces a rootfs; an overlayfs snapshotter is one implementation. OCI whiteout files must be interpreted, not exposed as ordinary application files. Layers may be uncompressed, gzip or zstd according to supported media types.','OCIformatnotrequiresoverlayfs/gzip.',[l,i])
e('one manifest per platform','platform-specific manifests and other supported entries','Indexnotnecessarilyexactlyoneperplatform.',[i])
e('**Integrity.** The client recomputes each digest after download; a tampered layer simply does not match.','**Integrity.** Verification checks downloaded content against its descriptor digest. That detects mismatching content, but publisher authenticity requires a trusted reference or separate verification policy.','Digestintegritynotpublisherauthentication.',[d])
e('Fifty images built on the same `debian` base share those base layers on disk and in the registry.','Identical blobs can be reused by content stores and registries; actual deduplication across stores, repositories and unpacked snapshots depends on implementation.','Identicalbase tagdoesnotproveidenticaldigest/alwaysonediskcopy.',[d])
e('            | (one per container)','            | (may group containers)','Currentcontainerdshimcanpodgroup.',[sh])
